00:19:50,720 --> 00:19:54,500
They're invincible now stay
the hell out of their way.

270
00:19:56,980 --> 00:20:02,680
Kaido something big just happened
come on we're headed to god valley.

271
00:20:05,400 --> 00:20:11,337
The rocks pirates are done for but how
what kind of joke is that they had the

272
00:20:11,420 --> 00:20:13,417
strongest pirates in
the world on their crew

273
00:20:13,500 --> 00:20:16,240
i heard a marine named garp took them out.

274
00:20:17,120 --> 00:20:19,414
Nah, I bet they just had a falling out.

275
00:20:19,500 --> 00:20:21,660
They were all power and no teamwork.

276
00:20:22,000 --> 00:20:23,765
Where the hell are you, Kaido?

277
00:20:25,600 --> 00:20:27,180
That little bastard!

278
00:20:27,460 --> 00:20:28,460
I'll kill him.

279
00:20:31,280 --> 00:20:32,960
Kyo, kyo, kyo, kyo.

280
00:20:33,220 --> 00:20:35,800
It's been ten years since then.

281
00:20:36,620 --> 00:20:40,160
Now you've become a one-man army, Kaido.

282
00:20:40,700 --> 00:20:42,060
Kyo, kyo, kyo.

283
00:20:42,780 --> 00:20:44,977
Throughout all of history,

284
00:20:45,060 --> 00:20:49,337
mankind has turned to violence
to solve every problem they face.

285
00:20:49,420 --> 00:20:52,117
As well they should, I say.

286
00:20:52,200 --> 00:20:54,397
We're animals, after all.

287
00:20:54,480 --> 00:20:57,797
The strong have always conquered the weak.

288
00:20:57,880 --> 00:20:59,717
Of course, but what's your point?

289
00:20:59,800 --> 00:21:03,580
The other remnants of the rocks
pirates will grow in power, too,

290
00:21:03,800 --> 00:21:10,140
I'm sure Weapons will decide the
future And I have plenty to spare

291
00:21:12,560 --> 00:21:17,117
the self-appointed rulers of
this world preach peace and they

292
00:21:17,200 --> 00:21:21,537
claim that power is their birthright
will drag them from their thrones

293
00:21:21,620 --> 00:21:23,357
and on to the battlefield

294
00:21:23,440 --> 00:21:29,697
a person's

295
00:21:29,780 --> 00:21:30,977
worth should be determined by

296
00:21:31,060 --> 00:21:35,740
strength that is the only way to
ensure true justice and Freedom!

297
00:21:41,220 --> 00:21:44,020
Sorry, but nothing's going to stop me now!

298
00:22:01,020 --> 00:22:03,717
I heard Yamato talking about Joy Boy.

299
00:22:03,800 --> 00:22:07,035
As for where he learned that
name, I couldn't tell you.

300
00:22:08,120 --> 00:22:12,880
But I know Odin was waiting until he
appeared to open up the borders of Wano.

301
00:22:13,820 --> 00:22:16,408
You're waiting for him
yourself, aren't you?

302
00:22:16,640 --> 00:22:17,875
That's what you said.

303
00:22:18,620 --> 00:22:22,660
In that case, I know
exactly who Joy Boy is.

304
00:22:45,720 --> 00:22:48,200
I cannot afford to be distracted again.

305
00:22:48,640 --> 00:22:51,000
I must trust that Lupi will triumph!

306
00:22:52,000 --> 00:22:53,160
That's the spirit!

307
00:22:53,860 --> 00:22:55,420
Save the land of Wano!

308
00:22:55,720 --> 00:22:57,300
Set its people free!

309
00:22:57,960 --> 00:22:59,880
Make those clowns!

310
00:22:59,980 --> 00:23:01,560
I know you can do it!

311
00:23:03,800 --> 00:23:05,940
Come forth, Flame Clouds!

312
00:23:06,080 --> 00:23:07,400
Heave my call!

313
00:23:21,200 --> 00:23:22,553
The hell is that noise?

314
00:23:28,120 --> 00:23:31,540
No fire can withstand this!

315
00:23:42,620 --> 00:23:46,660
The waters of soul shall deliver you!

316
00:23:59,220 --> 00:24:00,760
Whoa! Water!

317
00:24:01,640 --> 00:24:03,717
It's like they're raining
down from the sky!

318
00:24:03,800 --> 00:24:05,660
Wait, Black Nose!

319
00:24:06,820 --> 00:24:08,980
Don't die! Stay with me!

320
00:24:26,960 --> 00:24:28,197
I'm sorry.

321
00:24:28,280 --> 00:24:31,140
You've had to endure so much pain.

322
00:24:34,500 --> 00:24:38,360
For years and years,
you've remained strong.

323
00:24:40,880 --> 00:24:42,800
I almost lost you there!

324
00:24:43,220 --> 00:24:45,160
Hey, don't get washed away!

325
00:24:45,540 --> 00:24:46,400
Come back!

326
00:24:48,440 --> 00:24:50,180
Where'd this water come from?

327
00:24:51,900 --> 00:24:54,700
Whoa! Whoa! Whoa! I did it! Possumey!

328
00:24:59,900 --> 00:25:02,076
Something is happening to the island!

329
00:25:06,380 --> 00:25:09,100
The flame clouds, they're fading!

330
00:25:11,540 --> 00:25:12,960
This is it!

331
00:25:13,120 --> 00:25:15,040
Our time's up! It's falling!

332
00:25:21,800 --> 00:25:24,520
Come forth, flame clouds!

333
00:25:28,660 --> 00:25:30,080
You're amazing!

334
00:25:30,560 --> 00:25:31,457
That should be enough!

335
00:25:31,540 --> 00:25:32,440
Do it!

336
00:25:32,660 --> 00:25:33,980
Stop the island!

337
00:25:34,500 --> 00:25:36,420
You can count on me!

338
00:25:41,560 --> 00:25:42,800
Let's go!

339
00:26:01,540 --> 00:26:05,720
I'll crush every nation under
my heel, just like Wado!

340
00:26:06,160 --> 00:26:07,900
Do you know why you fight?

341
00:26:08,240 --> 00:26:10,358
What kind of world would you create?

342
00:26:11,120 --> 00:26:12,440
Straw Hats!

343
00:26:30,160 --> 00:26:32,540
What do I want?

344
00:26:33,920 --> 00:26:34,760
Luffy!

345
00:26:40,220 --> 00:26:44,120
I want a world where my friends can smile!

346
00:26:48,620 --> 00:26:51,680
Where they can eat until they're full!

347
00:26:52,620 --> 00:26:53,900
Every day!

348
00:27:05,380 --> 00:27:06,780
FIDAL!

349
00:27:37,440 --> 00:27:38,940
Oh, my God.

350
00:28:05,020 --> 00:28:07,480
I said I know who Joy Boy is.

351
00:28:08,060 --> 00:28:09,620
Aren't you curious, King?

352
00:28:11,540 --> 00:28:12,620
Who is it?

353
00:28:14,040 --> 00:28:18,060
He's the man who's going
to defeat me someday.

354
00:28:19,340 --> 00:28:21,520
Then maybe he doesn't exist.
